{%- comment -%}
  Hartwick Atelier — a Style name with its number in Cutch Resin.
  Aloha's All Clothing brief, 17 September 2026: "The numbered identifiers in
  Clothing names — such as 001 in Skirt 001 — use Cutch Resin #541F00 … the
  consistent colour code for Clothing numbering across the website, including
  the Collection Index, clothing listings and individual product pages."

      {% render 'ha-style-name', name: 'Skirt 001' %}
      -> Skirt <span class="ha-num">001</span>

  A name with no trailing number (a legacy title, an accessory) prints as is.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign parts = name | strip | split: ' ' -%}
{%- assign tail = parts | last -%}
{%- assign digits = tail | remove: '0' | remove: '1' | remove: '2' | remove: '3' | remove: '4' | remove: '5' | remove: '6' | remove: '7' | remove: '8' | remove: '9' -%}
{%- if parts.size > 1 and digits == blank and tail.size >= 2 -%}
  {%- assign keep = parts.size | minus: 1 -%}
  {{- parts | slice: 0, keep | join: ' ' }} <span class="ha-num">{{ tail }}</span>
{%- else -%}
  {{- name -}}
{%- endif -%}
